  "solution": {
    "text": "Given equation is a linear differential equation<br />Integrating factor <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math><br />So the equation is <math><mi>y</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math><br />Since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br />Therefore,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">lim</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></munder></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
